          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This dashboard depicts highest no of claim (8443) and claim amount (1077366700)   has been observed with Appendectomy package and disease.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>while the lowest claimed amount (1052288273) and no. of claims (8222) observed with delivery package </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>General surgeons are the highest among all other specialities with total no of claims (8443) indicates maximum patients belongs to this categoy.while the lowest accounts to obstetrics (8222)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>A monthly disease trend also shows total number of claims as per different ackages category.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>conclusion</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This shows general surgeons have the  maximum  no of patients with  appendectomy .</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
