        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='58600' id='46' type-v2='text' w='18342' x='80987' y='27600'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This dashboard overviews fraudulent claims which is maximum in </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>March (513) </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>remained high in </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>april (512)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>, and graudally declining.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Mamimum no. of fraud has been observed in </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>West bengal (533)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> while lowest observed in </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Gujarat(473).</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>fraud cases are almost equally distributed between </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>private (2498) </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>goverment(2491)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> hospitals.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Among different treatment packages </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Dialysis (859) </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>involes more fraud detection indicates higher volume of patients</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>throughout the analysis </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>249991</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> amount observed as the highest claim value.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>conclusion</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Fraud is concentrated in specific month , state and treatment packages.monitoring these areas can help to detect suspicious fraud  claims earlier and reduce financial losses.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
