          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>This dashboard show maximum no of claims and rejected claims has been recorded in May month while least in November.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>highest no of claims approved in April while lowest in November.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Appendectomy holds maximum claimed amount (1077366700) while delivery package lowest (1052288273).</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> Both the private and government hospitals almost has equa claim amount.while hospital no 22 generates the highest claim amount (5276865).</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>conclusion</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>maximum amount claimed in Appendectomy package in May out of which rejected amount also maximum in May</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>whereas maximum approved amount observed in April.</run>
          </formatted-text>
