        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='79700' id='70' type-v2='text' w='15556' x='889' y='14600'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Hospital 581</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> recorded the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>highest total claim amount, </run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>₹9,528,285</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>, indicating the largest claim value among all hospitals, suggest more expensive treatment or larger patient volume.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>whie </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Hospital 453</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> achieved the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>highest claim approval rate of 53.66%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>, demonstrating the strongest approval performance.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Government hospitals accounted for a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>higher total claim amount (₹3,203,317,217)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> compared to private hospitals.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>A total of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>50,000 claims</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'> were recorded during the analysis period, with an </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>average claim amount of ₹127,893</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>Patients had an </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>average hospital stay of 8 days</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>, providing insight into the typical duration of hospitalization across all hospitals.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>conclusion</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'>overall, hospital performance is relatively consistent in terms of approval rate and average length of stay, however certain hospital generates higher claim amount.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
